        "original_id": "1adb0719-aab2-50cd-a020-49c4a3aa2ca1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: April Margera, Phillip \"Phil\" Margera, Bam Margera\n- Organizations: Sirius Radio\n- Products: Radio Bam, Bam Radio, Viva La Bam, CKY Videos, Jackass\n- Topics: radio scheduling, guest appearances, reality television\n\nFacts:\n- Radio Bam, also called Bam Radio, was an exclusive Sirius Radio station that aired on Mondays at 7 p.m.\n- April Margera and Phillip \"Phil\" Margera made frequent guest appearances on Radio Bam.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera was born on July 13, 1957.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera is an American reality television personality.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY Videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
