        "text": "Radio Bam (or Bam Radio) was an exclusive Sirius Radio Station that aired on Mondays at 7pm, it had frequent guest appearances from Bam's parents April Margera and Phillip \"Phil\" Margera, the American reality television personality, best known for appearing on \"Viva La Bam\" , the \"CKY Videos\" and the \"Jackass\" television series and movies, born on July 13, 1957.",
