        "original_id": "8dee4e90-94ca-5cf8-878a-45ecca33f8af",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bam Margera, Phil Margera, April Margera, Brandon Dicamillo, Brandon Novak, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, Chris Raab, Don Vito\n- Organizations: CKY crew, Jackass crew\n- Products: Radio Bam, Viva La Bam, CKY Videos, Jackass\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Margera was born on July 13, 1957.\n- Phil Margera is an American reality television personality.\n- Phil Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY Videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.\n- In Radio Bam's early years, the show's supporting cast was originally made up of Bam Margera's fellow CKY crew members Brandon Dicamillo and Brandon Novak.\n- Brandon Dicamillo and Brandon Novak appeared on most episodes during Radio Bam's early years.\n- Radio Bam featured frequent guest appearances from Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, and Chris Raab.\n- Radio Bam also featured Bam Margera's parents April Margera and Phil Margera, his uncle Don Vito, and occasional appearances from the Jackass crew.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
